/**
 * \mainpage StEmcRawMaker — Maker that decodes raw electromagnetic calorimeter data into StEmcCollection
 *
 * \section emc_purpose Purpose
 * StEmcRawMaker reads raw BEMC (Barrel Electromagnetic Calorimeter) and EEMC
 * (Endcap Electromagnetic Calorimeter) sub-events from the STAR DAQ stream
 * and decodes them into \c StEmcRawData and \c StEmcRawHit objects stored
 * inside \c StEmcCollection in \c StEvent.  It also performs basic sub-event
 * corruption checks and fills QA monitoring histograms.
 *
 * \section emc_input Input
 * - Raw BEMC and EEMC DAQ sub-events via the RTS / \c StRTSBaseMaker reader.
 * - \c controlADCtoE calibration tables from the STAR database, controlling
 *   the ADC-to-energy conversion and status/cut-off settings per sub-detector.
 *
 * \section emc_output Output
 * - \b StEmcCollection inside StEvent, containing:
 *   - \c StEmcRawData  (raw ADC payload for each sub-detector)
 *   - \c StEmcRawHit   (calibrated tower / strip hits after ADC→E conversion)
 * - QA monitoring histograms written at job end.
 *
 * \section emc_classes Key Classes
 * | Class | Role |
 * |-------|------|
 * | StEmcRawMaker | Main maker; orchestrates BEMC and EEMC decoding |
 * | StBemcRaw | Handles raw BEMC data unpacking and hit filling |
 * | StEemcRaw | Handles raw EEMC data unpacking and hit filling |
 * | StEmcCollection | StEvent container for all EMC data |
 *
 * \section emc_usage Usage Example
 * \code{.cpp}
 * StEmcRawMaker* emcRaw = new StEmcRawMaker("EmcRaw");
 * chain->AddMaker(emcRaw);
 *
 * // Optional: tune ADC→E settings via BFC GoptEMC chain option, e.g.:
 * // chain->SetOption("GoptEMC000020");
 * \endcode
 *
 * \note This maker must run after StEventMaker and the DAQ reader,
 *       and before any calorimeter calibration or jet-finding maker.
 */
